<title>POLAND: Kable jumps on NKT Cables tender.</title>
<headline>Kable jumps on NKT Cables tender.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish cable maker Kable SA jumped 8.6 percent to 49 zlotys in heavy trade, extending Wednesday's surge after 50-percent owner NKT Cables on Monday called a public tender offer, traders said.</p>
<p>The Danish firm offered to buy Kable's remaining one million shares at the then market price of 41 zlotys.</p>
<p>Trade in the stock was suspended on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Traders said Kable shares should now lose steam or fall.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
